script = ExtResource("1_jdsdw")
dialogue_id = "debate_talisman_pouch"
record_title = "Debate Speech: The Talismans"
text = "PAGE: scribe(PORTAL_NETWORK), AUDIENCE
scribe: Many people today look at our customs as thoughtless imitation.
scribe: They think we are children following arbitrary rules.
scribe: But let us examine the humble seed pouches that so many of us wear at our belts.
scribe: Generations ago, the Enlightened One instructed our ancestors to weave these bags loosely and fill them with seeds.
scribe: For centuries, we have carried them as a symbol that we are the seeds of a new world, meant to sow what we may not harvest.
scribe: As we all know now, the loose cloth of our bags allows tiny seeds to slip out and scatter along the paths.
scribe: We have been unknowingly reseeding barren soil for centuries, lush fields sprouting in our wake.
scribe: One need not understand ecology to revive the land.
scribe: One simply needs to follow the divine wisdom.
scribe: We can study the world to comprehend the machinery of miracles, without rejecting the ones we cannot yet understand.
scribe: Faith is the candle we carry to push away the dark, until our knowledge is bright enough to dispel it."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://jtkfcsyiryo4"
